# The "AI Advice" tactical advisor is bring-your-own-key: each visitor pastes
# their own Gemini API key into the app (get one free from
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey), and it's stored only in their browser's
# localStorage. The browser calls Google's API directly with that key — it
# never touches this site's servers, and there's nothing to configure here.
#
# There is no build-time or server-side env var for this feature.
